   "date": "2016-06-07T14:07:58Z",
   "subject": "Re: Stop a time consuming function on button click Shiny",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Indeed input values seems to be updated only when all current reactive expression have end running, hence the issue your encountering.<br>Not sure how to fix that, though.<br></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "kWAyznBPFwAJ",
   "from": "Guillaume Devailly",
   "author": "0395e194dcba3ff3",
   "date": "2016-06-07T15:03:38Z",
   "subject": "Re: Stop a time consuming function on button click Shiny",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">All right, this is super-hacky, and might not be applicable to you depending on how easy it is to write the loop as a function.<br>It is extremely likely that there is a simpler, smarter way of doing it but I had great fun doing it.<br>Also, note the used of the evil &quot;&lt;&lt;-&quot; assignment.<br><br>Since input$ values are updated only when all reactive() elements have completed, I do the infinite loop by updating a dummy selectInput, which will trigger the next loop. Ideally, this selectInput should be hidden, for example using <a href=\"https://github.com/daattali/shinyjs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/daattali/shinyjs&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792393184272000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0XoYdrSWmu9CqaO4sBdEQm\">shinyjs::hide</a> or any other method you want.<br>I leave it displayed here for clarity.<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#800\"># ui.R</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>shinyUI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">fluidPage</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sidebarLayout</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    sidebarPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span></div></code></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        actionButton</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;startSearch&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> label </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Start Search&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span></div></code></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        actionButton</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;stopSearch&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  label </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Stop Search&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        selectInput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;loopIter&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> label </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;(hide this input)&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> choices </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    mainPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        textOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;myText&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        textOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;myResults&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">)))</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Saisissez</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> le code ici</span><span style=\"color:#660\">...</span></div></code></div><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#800\"># server.R</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>shinyServer</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> output</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> session</span><span style=\"color:#660\">){</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># can you write one loop as function?</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    runLoopOnce </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Sys</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sleep</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        </span><span style=\"color:#008\">return</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># results from loop will be stored there</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    resultList </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># initialistation of variables, updated with &lt;&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    start </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    stop </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    iter </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># we manage start of the loop here</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    myReactive1 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> reactive</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        </span><span style=\"color:#008\">if</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$startSearch </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> start</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>            iter </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">as</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$loopIter</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># , Reactive, so will run each time loopIter is updated</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>            resultList</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">iter</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> runLoopOnce</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># we run the loop once</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>            updateSelectInput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">session</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;loopIter&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> choices </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">iter</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># loopIter is udated, will re-run again, infinite loop \\o/</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        </span><span style=\"color:#008\">return</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">iter</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># we manage stop of the loop here</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    myReactive2 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> reactive</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        </span><span style=\"color:#008\">if</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$stopSearch </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> stop</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>            start </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> input$startSearch<br>            stop </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> input$stopSearch</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>            </span><span style=\"color:#008\">return</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">iter</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># we stop the loop without calling myReactive1, hence without updating loopIter</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">else</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>            </span><span style=\"color:#008\">return</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">myReactive1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">())</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># display number of iteration</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    output$myText </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> renderText</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        paste</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Loop has runned&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> myReactive2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;time(s).&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># display the reslut, a nice list of ones</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    output$myResults </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> renderText</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        input$loopIter<br>        paste</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">unlist</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">resultList</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> collapse </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot; &quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span></div></code></div><br><br><br></div>"
    ]
   ]
  }
 ]
}
